[2m│[m How harness communicates. Pass a name to /output-style to skip this list.                                            [2m│[m
[2m│[m   1. Default                                                                                                         [2m│[m
[2m│[m      Completes coding tasks efficiently with concise responses                                                       [2m│[m
[2m│[m   2. Proactive                                                                                                       [2m│[m
[2m│[m      Takes initiative on obvious next steps                                                                          [2m│[m
[2m│[m   3. Concise                                                                                                         [2m│[m
[2m│[m      Short answers, no preamble                                                                                      [2m│[m
[2m│[m [1m❯[m 4. [1;7mExplanatory ✔[m                                                                                                   [2m│[m
[2m│[m      Explains implementation choices and codebase patterns                                                           [2m│[m
[2m│[m   5. Learning                                                                                                        [2m│[m
[2m│[m      Pauses and asks you to write small pieces of code                                                               [2m│[m
[2m│[m   6. Terse                                                                                                           [2m│[m
[2m│[m      One-line answers · project                                                                                      [2m│[m
[2m│[m   7. pirate                                                                                                          [2m│[m
[2m│[m      user                                                                                                            [2m│[m
[2m│[m   8. New style…                                                                                                      [2m│[m
